  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fapplyPromo%252fHomeGrownMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/576589/description_c104abd7-58db-4f58-b718-a8ddafa3364f.png\"></a></p>\n<p>「PolyLib」由 CreeperHost Ltd. 開發，是一款精簡的 Minecraft 程式庫模組，專注於提供一系列輔助類別。這些類別旨在簡化模組開發的各項工作，包含更方便的 GUI 建立工具與其他開發增強功能，以有效提升開發效率與使用者體驗。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>PolyLib 基於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury</a> 開發，適用於 NeoForge、Forge 與 Fabric；自 Minecraft 26.1.2 起，已不再需要 Architectury。</p>\n<p>PolyLib 為開源專案，原始碼可於 <a href=\"https://github.com/CreeperHost/PolyLib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a> 取得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>需要 PolyLib 的模組</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeperhost-presents-soul-shards\" rel=\"nofollow\">SoulShards</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blockshot\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlockShot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeperhost-minetogether\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineTogether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shrink_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shrink</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeperhost-presents-steves-carts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Steve's Carts 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeperhost-presents-chickens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chickens</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Jab125/Jab125/main/imgs/requiredArchitecturyApi.png\" width=\"382\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p><br>&nbsp;</p>",
